// Windows resource script: gives ftys.exe a real taskbar/Explorer icon
// instead of the generic default one. Only consumed when building with
// WIN32 (see CMakeLists.txt, which adds this file to the ftys executable's
// sources only `if(WIN32)`) -- ignored entirely on Linux/macOS, where the
// app icon instead comes from assets/ftys_logo.png via gui/resources.qrc
// and QApplication::setWindowIcon() in app/main.cpp.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "ftys.ico"
